DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:25pm\, 1:25pm\, 2:25pm\, 4pm\, 5pm\, 6:25pm\, 7:35pm\
 , 8:35pm\nThirty-four days before she’s sent to prison\, notorious Silic
 on Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invites a skeptical film crew to docume
 nt her every move. What begins as an intimate portrait of an enigmatic fel
 on becomes a mind-bending three-year journey into the abyss. From boundary
 -pushing directors Nathan Fielder and Lance Oppenheim comes YOU CAN SEE EV
 ERYTHING.\nhttps://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/88cc3ef4-
 7e58-570b-a00e-0f6dc6ebfbb9\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/bos
 ton/
