SUMMARY:Fjord
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:From two time Palm d'Or winner Cristian Mungiu\, a Norwegian wo
 man and her devout Romanian husband relocate with their five children to a
  remote\, close-knit\, coastal town. Their teenage children form a fast bo
 nd with a neighboring family as unease begins to simmer around their rigid
  beliefs. When allegations of abuse emerge\, they are forced to confront a
  system of judgement that blurs the lines between concern and prejudice.\n
 https://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/ca68b77c-e1e1-5190-9
 64b-1a5be3606165\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
