SUMMARY:$5 Secret Movie 11/2/26
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:Be the first to see new and innovative films before they are wi
 dely released. Witness a diverse range of cinema\, including independent f
 ilms\, documentaries\, foreign films\, and more! Join us for this exclusiv
 e screening and be among the first to experience groundbreaking cinema! Pr
 eviously Shown: DIDI\, BETWEEN THE TEMPLES\, MY OLD ASS\, MEMOIR OF A SNAI
 L\, THE ORDER\, SEPTEMBER 5TH\, THE LAST SHOWGIRL\, BRING THEM DOWN\, NOVO
 CAINE\, DROP\, JANE AUSTEN WRECKED MY LIFE\, BRING HER BACK\, THE LIFE OF 
 CHUCK\, JURASSIC WORLD REBIRTH\, EAST OF WALL\, ELEANOR THE GREAT\, NUREMB
 ERG\, ROOFMAN\, THE MASTERMIND\, ETERNITY\, SONG SUNG BLUE\, GOOD LUCK\, H
 AVE FUN\, DON'T DIE\, HOW TO MAKE A KILLING\, FANTASY LIFE\, FUZE\, THE SH
 EEP DETECTIVES\, TUNER\, GAIL DAUGHTRY AND THE CELEBRITY SEX PASS MOTOR CI
 TY\, ONE NIGHT ONLY\, THE BRINK OF WAR\, TONY\, IDIOTS\, FORGOTTEN ISLAND\
 , HEART OF THE BEAST\, SENSE AND SENSIBILITY\, THE ONLY LIVING PICKPOCKET 
 IN NEW YORK.\nhttps://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/da2065
 2f-c025-5186-8d94-0492dd5e363e\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
 boston/
URL:https://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/da20652f-c025-518
 6-8d94-0492dd5e363e
